{"v":1,"source":"Moonton (mobilelegends.com)","patch":"2.2.16","updated":"2026-10-08","hero":{"name":"Phoveus","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_af21c0dd8b5308c27974bff900803a9a.png","head_big":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_b811616b91e45a75437a6d5b9f386bd3.jpg","square":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_250c4be7ee7b3d5d17248d9e7050fb15.jpg","squarebig":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b811616b91e45a75437a6d5b9f386bd3.jpg","smallmap":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6bfe8ca7e60623a5261eac20e2b39d34.png","wallpaper":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9abf963fae03d641bac528f6fab2b8c2.png","hero_id":106,"wallpaper_source":"painting"},"stats":{"win":48.16,"pick":0.25,"ban":0.5},"compat":{"metric":"pp","best":[{"hero":"Bane","value":3.1},{"hero":"Khaleed","value":2.2},{"hero":"Aulus","value":1.4},{"hero":"Angela","value":1.4},{"hero":"Argus","value":1.4}],"worst":[{"hero":"Terizla","value":-6.5},{"hero":"Arlott","value":-5.8},{"hero":"Lapu-Lapu","value":-5.0},{"hero":"Sora","value":-4.9},{"hero":"Aldous","value":-4.8}]},"lore":{"short":"A former soldier from the border of the Empire who took on the chains of sin to defend his people.","long":null},"meta":{"difficulty":"40","speciality":["Regen","Damage"],"roadsort":["Exp Lane"],"sort":["Fighter"],"recommend":"3-1-2","sorticon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1660a04f7dc87095c97aaf32f44d685c.png","roadicon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9a93311ae387f9ffe5a7efa5e341eb9e.png"},"skills":[{"id":10640,"name":"Demonic Force","description":"Phoveus's next Basic Attack charges at the enemy, knocking them back, dealing extra Magic Damage equal to 4% - 6% of the enemy's  (scales with level), and gaining a 8% - 12%  shield. Cooldown: 26s-14s (based on Infernal Pursuit's level).\n\nAstaros' Gaze: Whenever an enemy hero blinks, dashes, or is displaced within 8 units, reduces the cooldown of Demonic Force by 20% and other skills by 0.5s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_be31ba6b65c2da1b4d2d0961ee1ffd85.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":10610,"name":"Demonic Impact","description":"Phoveus slams his monolith into the ground, dealing 200 (+120% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in the area and slowing them by 70% for 0.5s. If this skill hits an enemy, Phoveus's next Demonic Impact will leave behind an Astaros Eye.\n\nAstaros Eye: Implodes after a short delay, dealing 100 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Magic Damage to the enemies.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5748e21d6ff5231b05a6acae7d4665c1.png","video":null,"cd":6.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":10620,"name":"Dark Wave","description":"Phoveus lowers his monolith and releases his demonic power in the target direction, knocking enemies airborne, dragging them along, and dealing 250 (+100% Extra Physical Attack) Magic Damage.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0e6fc7263f921c1084d7a47805648fab.png","video":null,"cd":10.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":10630,"name":"Infernal Pursuit","description":"Passive: Demonic Force, Astaros Eye, and Dark Wave apply Sinner's Mark to enemy heroes hit.\n\nActive: Phoveus leaps into the air and smashes down with his monolith at the enemy hero with Sinner's Mark, dealing 250 (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+ 5% target's ) Physical Damage to enemies in the area and recovering 50 (+ 6% of his ).\n\nInfernal Pursuit can only be used when there are enemies with Sinner's Mark nearby. HP recovered is reduced by 80% when multiple enemies are hit.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_295a1e427d8b39ba25c3779cf32ff7d2.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Tanks with good initiation like Gatotkaca, Minotaur, and Tigreal can create opportunities for Phoveus to maximize his damage while they take some of the incoming damage.","heroes":[{"id":41,"name":"Gatotkaca","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png"},{"id":19,"name":"Minotaur","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ecd2c0843df7ec85044dafff6bf4553.png"},{"id":6,"name":"Tigreal","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8b30576754be1a4f8bebd09df8d6bec7.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Enemies with multiple mobility abilities can greatly reduce Phoveus's cooldowns, so he can use his enhanced Basic Attacks and skills more often when facing heroes like Wanwan, Arlott, and Chou.","heroes":[{"id":89,"name":"Wanwan","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_44bfa1dc44deb8d7620605faaa9ffae7.png"},{"id":120,"name":"Arlott","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f666faa5ec6be5353f10dcd1d8997a42.png"},{"id":26,"name":"Chou","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_158209b180032c4564b8f3bde8c48888.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Phoveus will struggle against ranged heroes with strong CC, such as Aurora, Valir, and Vexana.","heroes":[{"id":36,"name":"Aurora","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f9b2be0150361018bb98f941b9667c42.png"},{"id":57,"name":"Valir","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bf16690876761b80822df90eb3320d69.png"},{"id":38,"name":"Vexana","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_743edd1702084c4ed247908d698bca77.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/lore/hero/PhoveusRE","skins":[{"name":"Chains Of Sin","name_slug":"Chains-of-Sin","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/phoveus/Phoveus-Chains-of-Sin-20240805140512.webp","image_filename":"Phoveus-Chains-of-Sin-20240805140512.webp","released":"2024-08-05","is_original":true},{"name":"Matrix Maverick","name_slug":"Matrix-Maverick","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/phoveus/Phoveus-Matrix-Maverick-20250822115421.webp","image_filename":"Phoveus-Matrix-Maverick-20250822115421.webp","released":"2025-08-22","is_original":false},{"name":"Monolith Watcher","name_slug":"Monolith-Watcher","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/phoveus/Phoveus-Monolith-Watcher-20250917082515.webp","image_filename":"Phoveus-Monolith-Watcher-20250917082515.webp","released":"2025-09-17","is_original":false},{"name":"Matrix Marauder","name_slug":"Matrix-Marauder","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/phoveus/Phoveus-Matrix-Marauder-20250920022827.webp","image_filename":"Phoveus-Matrix-Marauder-20250920022827.webp","released":"2025-09-20","is_original":false}]}